វីដេអូបណ្តុះបណ្តាល ៥ នាទី៖ https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/03_KHANA_Pluslife_Training_Video.mp4','Safety-critical','Study focal point (if not solved) – Roeub Sievlong (Telegram 093 54 55 72)');
INSERT INTO kb_qa (id,issue_id,category,question_en,question_km,answer_en,answer_km,priority,escalate_to) VALUES ('MO-01-Q01','MO-01','Mis-operation','Can I insert the card while the device is still warming up?','តើខ្ញុំអាចដាក់កាត ពេលម៉ាស៊ីននៅកំពុងកំដៅបានទេ?','No. Wait until the light is solid blue (ready) before inserting the card. Inserting it during warm-up can activate the reaction improperly.
