វីដេអូបណ្តុះបណ្តាល ៥ នាទី៖ https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/03_KHANA_Pluslife_Training_Video.mp4','Safety-critical','Study focal point (if not solved) – Roeub Sievlong (Telegram 093 54 55 72)');
INSERT INTO kb_qa (id,issue_id,category,question_en,question_km,answer_en,answer_km,priority,escalate_to) VALUES ('MO-04-Q02','MO-04','Mis-operation','Can I leave the used card in the device until the next test?','តើអាចទុកកាតប្រើរួចក្នុងម៉ាស៊ីន រហូតដល់តេស្តបន្ទាប់បានទេ?','No. Put the card in the waste bag right after the result and seal the bag. Leaving cards around increases the risk of contamination.
