Step-by-step procedure (Khmer): https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/02_KHANA_Pluslife_Procedure.pdf
Training video, 5 min (Khmer): https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/03_KHANA_Pluslife_Training_Video.mp4','បើកថង់ស្អាតគ្មានមេរោគ ហើយយកដំបងសំឡីចេញ ដោយកាន់តែដងខាងលើ (ពីលើចំណុចបំបាក់)។ កុំប៉ះចុងសំឡី ហើយកុំបំបាក់ដំបងសំឡី។

ឯកសារណែនាំផ្នែកគ្លីនិក (Clinical procedure)៖ https://docs.google.com/document/d/1d9w2ffsIa9-XLKiivnDRyfWvPhNWLOBp/edit
