Step-by-step procedure (Khmer): https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/02_KHANA_Pluslife_Procedure.pdf
Training video, 5 min (Khmer): https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/03_KHANA_Pluslife_Training_Video.mp4','លាងសំណាកចេញ (elute) ដោយបង្វិល និងច្របាច់ដំបងសំឡីទល់នឹងជញ្ជាំងបំពង់ ប្រហែល ១០ ដង រួចដកដំបងសំឡីចេញ ហើយបោះចោល។ កុំទុកវាក្នុងបំពង់ជាដាច់ខាត។
សៀវភៅមានរូបភាព៖ https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/01_KHANA_Pluslife_Booklet.pdf
ជំហានធ្វើតេស្ត៖ https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/02_KHANA_Pluslife_Procedure.pdf
វីដេអូបណ្តុះបណ្តាល ៥ នាទី៖ https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/03_KHANA_Pluslife_Training_Video.mp4','Safety-critical','Study focal point (if not solved) – Roeub Sievlong (Telegram 093 54 55 72)');
INSERT INTO kb_qa (id,issue_id,category,question_en,question_km,answer_en,answer_km,priority,escalate_to) VALUES ('SP-01-Q01','SP-01','Sample Pretreatment','Should I leave the swab in the elution tube?','តើគួរទុកដំបងសំឡីក្នុងបំពង់ elution ទេ?','No. Remove and discard the swab after elution. Never leave it in the tube.
