វីដេអូបណ្តុះបណ្តាល ៥ នាទី៖ https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/03_KHANA_Pluslife_Training_Video.mp4','Routine','Study focal point (if not solved) – Roeub Sievlong (Telegram 093 54 55 72)');
INSERT INTO kb_qa (id,issue_id,category,question_en,question_km,answer_en,answer_km,priority,escalate_to) VALUES ('DO-02-Q10','DO-02','Device Operation','How can I tell from the lights whether the device is warming up, ready or testing?','ធ្វើម៉េចដឹងពីភ្លើង ថាម៉ាស៊ីនកំពុងកំដៅ រួចរាល់ ឬកំពុងធ្វើតេស្ត?','Red flashing (after power-on): warming up.
Solid blue: ready, insert the card.
Blue flashing: test running, don''t open the lid.
Beeping + red flashing: alarm, check the message in the software.
After the test: the lights show the result (Positive / Negative).
