វីដេអូបណ្តុះបណ្តាល ៥ នាទី៖ https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/03_KHANA_Pluslife_Training_Video.mp4','Routine','Study focal point (if not solved) – Roeub Sievlong (Telegram 093 54 55 72)');
INSERT INTO kb_qa (id,issue_id,category,question_en,question_km,answer_en,answer_km,priority,escalate_to) VALUES ('DO-03-Q12','DO-03','Device Operation','I''m new — walk me through running a test once the card is ready.','ខ្ញុំទើបតែចាប់ផ្តើម — សូមប្រាប់ជំហានធ្វើតេស្ត ពេលកាតរួចរាល់។','1) Check the light is solid blue.
2) Open the lid and push the card fully into the bottom slot in the indicated direction (1 beep).
3) Close the lid immediately. The test starts automatically (blue light flashes).
4) Don''t open the lid during the test.
5) A second beep means it''s finished; the lights show the result.

Video (1 min): https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q4P0pGz8hhM
Full video: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BT2BGlf3H8M&t=42s
Operation procedure: https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/02_KHANA_Pluslife_Procedure.pdf
Picture booklet (Khmer): https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/01_KHANA_Pluslife_Booklet.pdf
Step-by-step procedure (Khmer): https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/02_KHANA_Pluslife_Procedure.pdf
Training video, 5 min (Khmer): https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/03_KHANA_Pluslife_Training_Video.mp4','១) ពិនិត្យថាភ្លើងពណ៌ខៀវភ្លឺជាប់។
២) បើកគម្រប ហើយរុញកាតចូលរន្ធខាងក្រោមឲ្យដល់បាត តាមទិសដៅដែលបានបង្ហាញ (ប៊ីប ១ ដង)។
៣) បិទគម្របភ្លាមៗ។ តេស្តចាប់ផ្តើមដោយស្វ័យប្រវត្តិ (ភ្លើងពណ៌ខៀវភ្លឹបភ្លែត)។
៤) កុំបើកគម្របពេលកំពុងធ្វើតេស្ត។
៥) សំឡេងប៊ីបលើកទី២ មានន័យថាតេស្តចប់។ ភ្លើងបង្ហាញលទ្ធផល។

