- Pluslife + / GeneXpert-TrueNat −: start the standard regimen immediately on the Pluslife result.
- Pluslife − / GeneXpert-TrueNat +: treat on the GeneXpert/TrueNat result (standard regimen, or drug-resistant TB regimen if resistance is detected).

Result decision guide: [Result Decision Guide - Pending]
Clinical flow chart in Khmer: [Clinical flow chart (Khmer) - Pending]','តាមសៀវភៅណែនាំការសម្រេចគ្លីនិក៖
- Pluslife + / GeneXpert-TrueNat −៖ ចាប់ផ្តើមរបបព្យាបាលស្តង់ដារភ្លាមៗ ផ្អែកលើលទ្ធផល Pluslife។
