Step-by-step procedure (Khmer): https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/02_KHANA_Pluslife_Procedure.pdf
Training video, 5 min (Khmer): https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/03_KHANA_Pluslife_Training_Video.mp4','ចាត់ទុកវាជាកាកសំណល់វេជ្ជសាស្ត្រឆ្លង តាមបទប្បញ្ញត្តិ។
