Training video, 5 min (Khmer): https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/03_KHANA_Pluslife_Training_Video.mp4','ពី ១ ទៅ ៣ សំណាក ក្នុងពេលតែមួយ។
