ជំហានធ្វើតេស្ត៖ https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/02_KHANA_Pluslife_Procedure.pdf
វីដេអូបណ្តុះបណ្តាល ៥ នាទី៖ https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/03_KHANA_Pluslife_Training_Video.mp4','Safety-critical','Study focal point (if not solved) – Roeub Sievlong (Telegram 093 54 55 72)');
INSERT INTO kb_qa (id,issue_id,category,question_en,question_km,answer_en,answer_km,priority,escalate_to) VALUES ('SP-12-Q05','SP-12','Sample Pretreatment','Do I need new gloves after a spill?','តើខ្ញុំត្រូវការស្រោមដៃថ្មី បន្ទាប់ពីជ្រួលឬទេ?','Yes. Change gloves before proceeding with the test.
Picture booklet (Khmer): https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/01_KHANA_Pluslife_Booklet.pdf
Step-by-step procedure (Khmer): https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/02_KHANA_Pluslife_Procedure.pdf
Training video, 5 min (Khmer): https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/03_KHANA_Pluslife_Training_Video.mp4','បាទ/ចាស។ ប្តូរស្រោមដៃ មុនបន្តធ្វើតេស្ត។
សៀវភៅមានរូបភាព៖ https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/01_KHANA_Pluslife_Booklet.pdf
ជំហានធ្វើតេស្ត៖ https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/02_KHANA_Pluslife_Procedure.pdf
វីដេអូបណ្តុះបណ្តាល ៥ នាទី៖ https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/03_KHANA_Pluslife_Training_Video.mp4','Safety-critical','Study focal point (if not solved) – Roeub Sievlong (Telegram 093 54 55 72)');
INSERT INTO kb_qa (id,issue_id,category,question_en,question_km,answer_en,answer_km,priority,escalate_to) VALUES ('CP-06','CP-06','Card Preparation','Worker unsure how much releasing agent to load, or loaded too much/too little','បុគ្គលិកមិនច្បាស់ថាត្រូវដាក់សារធាតុបញ្ចេញប៉ុន្មានចូលកាត ឬបានដាក់ច្រើនពេក/តិចពេក','The releasing agent tube contains 2 mL (2000 µL). The amount added to the test card should be 0.4–0.5 mL (corresponding to the upper and lower marks on the card), with a nominal loading volume of 450 µL.
If the releasing agent is excessive, the liquid may not be able to flow into each chamber due to pressure imbalance. If too little is added, the liquid may fail to fill the chambers properly. Both situations can cause large air bubbles and affect the result. It is recommended to add the liquid up to the middle of the scale lines on the card.
Picture booklet (Khmer): https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/01_KHANA_Pluslife_Booklet.pdf
Step-by-step procedure (Khmer): https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/02_KHANA_Pluslife_Procedure.pdf
Training video, 5 min (Khmer): https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/03_KHANA_Pluslife_Training_Video.mp4','បំពង់សារធាតុបញ្ចេញ (releasing agent) មានទំហំ 2 mL (2000 µL)។ បរិមាណដែលត្រូវដាក់ចូលកាតតេស្តគួរតែ 0.4–0.5 mL (ត្រូវនឹងស្លាកខាងលើ និងខាងក្រោមលើកាត) ដោយបរិមាណដាក់ចូលតាមឈ្មោះគឺ 450 µL។
បើសារធាតុបញ្ចេញច្រើនពេក រាវអាចមិនហូរចូលក្នុងរន្ធនីមួយៗបាន ដោយសារសម្ពាធមិនស្មើគ្នា។ បើដាក់តិចពេក រាវអាចមិនបំពេញរន្ធបានត្រឹមត្រូវ។ ករណីទាំងពីរអាចបង្កើតពពុះខ្យល់ធំ ហើយប៉ះពាល់ដល់លទ្ធផល។ ណែនាំឲ្យដាក់រាវដល់ពាក់កណ្តាលនៃបន្ទាត់មាត្រដ្ឋានលើកាត។
សៀវភៅមានរូបភាព៖ https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/01_KHANA_Pluslife_Booklet.pdf
ជំហានធ្វើតេស្ត៖ https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/02_KHANA_Pluslife_Procedure.pdf
វីដេអូបណ្តុះបណ្តាល ៥ នាទី៖ https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/03_KHANA_Pluslife_Training_Video.mp4','Safety-critical','Study focal point (if not solved) – Roeub Sievlong (Telegram 093 54 55 72)');
INSERT INTO kb_qa (id,issue_id,category,question_en,question_km,answer_en,answer_km,priority,escalate_to) VALUES ('CP-06-Q01','CP-06','Card Preparation','How much liquid do I add to the card?','តើខ្ញុំត្រូវបន្ថែមរាវប៉ុន្មានចូលកាត?','0.4–0.5 mL (between the upper and lower marks on the card), with a nominal loading volume of 450 µL. It is recommended to add the liquid up to the middle of the scale lines.
Picture booklet (Khmer): https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/01_KHANA_Pluslife_Booklet.pdf
Step-by-step procedure (Khmer): https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/02_KHANA_Pluslife_Procedure.pdf
Training video, 5 min (Khmer): https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/03_KHANA_Pluslife_Training_Video.mp4','0.4–0.5 mL (រវាងស្លាកខាងលើ និងខាងក្រោមលើកាត) ដោយបរិមាណដាក់ចូលតាមឈ្មោះគឺ 450 µL។ ណែនាំឲ្យដាក់រាវដល់ពាក់កណ្តាលនៃបន្ទាត់មាត្រដ្ឋាន។
សៀវភៅមានរូបភាព៖ https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/01_KHANA_Pluslife_Booklet.pdf
ជំហានធ្វើតេស្ត៖ https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/02_KHANA_Pluslife_Procedure.pdf
វីដេអូបណ្តុះបណ្តាល ៥ នាទី៖ https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/03_KHANA_Pluslife_Training_Video.mp4','Safety-critical','Study focal point (if not solved) – Roeub Sievlong (Telegram 093 54 55 72)');
INSERT INTO kb_qa (id,issue_id,category,question_en,question_km,answer_en,answer_km,priority,escalate_to) VALUES ('CP-06-Q02','CP-06','Card Preparation','How much is in the releasing agent tube?','តើមានអ្វីប៉ុន្មានក្នុងបំពង់សារធាតុបញ្ចេញ?','2 mL (2000 µL).
