បើត្រូវការជំនួយ សូមទាក់ទង លោក រឿប សៀវឡុង តាម Telegram៖ 093 54 55 72។','Routine','Study focal point → Pluslife – Roeub Sievlong (Telegram 093 54 55 72)');
INSERT INTO kb_qa (id,issue_id,category,question_en,question_km,answer_en,answer_km,priority,escalate_to) VALUES ('DO-07-Q04','DO-07','Device Operation','Why does warm-up take longer in the morning?','ហេតុអ្វីបានជាការកំដៅចំណាយពេលយូរជាងនៅពេលព្រឹក?','The warm-up time depends on the ambient temperature when the device is turned on. Warm-up brings the device to its preset temperature (about 60 °C). The time depends on the ambient temperature when the device is turned on; at an ambient temperature of 25 °C, warm-up takes 1–2 minutes from power-on. If warm-up has not completed after more than 5 minutes and the red light keeps flashing, or the power indicator goes off, please contact your distributor promptly.
Picture booklet (Khmer): https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/01_KHANA_Pluslife_Booklet.pdf
Step-by-step procedure (Khmer): https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/02_KHANA_Pluslife_Procedure.pdf
Training video, 5 min (Khmer): https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/03_KHANA_Pluslife_Training_Video.mp4
Need help? Contact Roeub Sievlong on Telegram: 093 54 55 72.','រយៈពេលកំដៅអាស្រ័យលើសីតុណ្ហភាពបរិស្ថានពេលបើកម៉ាស៊ីន។ ការកំដៅ (warm-up) នាំម៉ាស៊ីនឡើងដល់សីតុណ្ហភាពកំណត់ជាមុន (ប្រហែល 60 °C)។ នៅសីតុណ្ហភាពបរិស្ថាន 25 °C ការកំដៅត្រូវការ ១–២ នាទី ចាប់ពីពេលបើក។ បើការកំដៅមិនទាន់ចប់ក្រោយលើសពី ៥ នាទី ហើយភ្លើងក្រហមនៅតែភ្លឹបភ្លែត ឬភ្លើងសញ្ញាថាមពលរលត់ សូមទាក់ទងអ្នកចែកចាយរបស់អ្នកជាបន្ទាន់។
សៀវភៅមានរូបភាព៖ https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/01_KHANA_Pluslife_Booklet.pdf
ជំហានធ្វើតេស្ត៖ https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/02_KHANA_Pluslife_Procedure.pdf
