វីដេអូបណ្តុះបណ្តាល ៥ នាទី៖ https://telegram-learning.lab-telegram-gemini-d1.workers.dev/files/03_KHANA_Pluslife_Training_Video.mp4','Routine','Study focal point (if not solved) – Roeub Sievlong (Telegram 093 54 55 72)');
INSERT INTO kb_qa (id,issue_id,category,question_en,question_km,answer_en,answer_km,priority,escalate_to) VALUES ('DO-12-Q01','DO-12','Device Operation','Is it normal for the light to flash red after I turn the device on?','តើជារឿងធម្មតាឬទេ ដែលភ្លើងភ្លឹបភ្លែតក្រហម បន្ទាប់ពីខ្ញុំបើកម៉ាស៊ីន?','Yes, it is normal. After pressing the power button, the device flashing red indicates that it is heating up. After about 1–2 minutes, the indicator will turn blue, indicating that the device is ready.
